          "But the Serbian handed Vacherot a lifeline with a missed forehand volley at the net when leading 5/4. The Monegasque seized the opportunity, moving to set point at 6/5 with a well-placed backhand volley before clinching the opener when Djokovic sent a backhand return long.",
